    "body": "Actually there is a WPT to check whether the updated text or original text is evaluated (not using MutationObserver though):\r\n\r\nhttps://wpt.fyi/results/html/semantics/scripting-1/the-script-element/script-text-modifications.html\r\n\r\nThis fails on Firefox/Safari, but I didn't notice that this affects CSP hash checks.\r\nAdding more tests...",
