    "updated_at": "2022-05-02T23:17:42Z",
    "body": "So, there are two issues:\r\n\r\n- [A] Inline script text content used for CSP check and evaluation when modified around `#prepare-a-script`. Chromium works as specified and Firefox and Safari don't.\r\n- [B] MutationObserver and prepare-a-script timing. Regardless of this timing, [A] should work consistenyly & robustly, because even without MutationObserver there are other ways that can modify text content before or after `#prepare-a-script` before evaluation.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
