    "created_at": "2022-05-03T00:44:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-03T00:44:57Z",
    "body": "As for chrome+nonce, if nonce is modified by the MutationObserver, I suspect the updated nonce is used for CSP nonce check, and this is the same as chrome+hash, i.e. preparation or MutationObserver happened at the wrong time, and updated text and nonce are used for preparation and evaluation consistently.\r\n(The MutationObserver in the example above doesn't affect the nonce case, because the CSP nonce check doesn't use script's text content)",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
